11-11 Add pure-func: basic params, no I/O
    params: (a int, b int), results: (int)
13-13 Join pure-func: basic params, no I/O
    params: (parts []string, sep string), results: (string)
15-20 Sum pure-func: basic params, no I/O
    params: (xs ...float64), results: (s float64)
22-22 Days pure-func: basic params, no I/O
    params: (start time.Time, end time.Time), results: (int)
24-24 Label pure-func: basic params, no I/O
    params: (n int), results: (string)
hint 35 dates: time.Now() uses the server's local time zone; call .UTC() or .In(loc) before working with the date
